STATUS = 'collector-approved-pilot'
DECISIONS = ['Collector, 2026-10-15: pilot approved as the pattern for the other rooms; the audio narration written with the text and the arc from first to last work are what the collector wants.']

INTRO = ['For ten weeks in the spring of 2022 the same formula held: one flat color, one black shape, and a ring of short wavy lines. Twenty-eight works came out of it, from a snarling cat on March 25 to a '
 'cat the size of a hill on June 2. What each creature is, and what it is doing, comes through the outline alone.',
 'Inside the black there is almost nothing. A pair of spiral eyes, or two small X marks, and sometimes a row of jagged teeth. A spiral makes a cat look dizzy or wild. An X closes an eye for good, '
 'and the same X on a rabbit, a bee and a whole crowd of heads runs through the room like a signature.',
 'The wavy lines are the other constant. They sit in the color around the figure, never touching it, and they make a still black shape hum. Watch them when a black horizon arrives under the '
 'creatures, when the figures turn hairy, and when, in the last days, the black is nearly all that is left.']

